  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You draw extra energy from certain environments.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Terrain Casting drawback, non-good alignment.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Choose one type of terrain from the ranger’s list of favored terrains. Whenever you use Terrain Casting to blight this terrain, you may increase your caster level for the blight-causing effect by 1. This bonus to caster level is a competence bonus.</p>\n<p><strong>Four Defiler Feats:</strong> Rather than 1, your caster level increases by 2.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects do not stack. Each time you take the feat, it applies to a new terrain. You cannot gain this feat if you possess the Terrain Focus feat and vice versa.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/drawback-feats#toc102\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
